  "note": "6.4.5: \"A property that no support has covered at or before the cutoff (`not_in_force`, 6.6.1) does not count toward the expectation's overall standing. The expectation remains open while any covered property is `outstanding` or `not_yet_due`; it is closed when every covered property is `fulfilled` or `withdrawn`; it is reported as fulfilled only when every covered property is `fulfilled` (6.6.2).\" README section 5 <overall> leaves the `not_in_force` properties out. Steps 12 and 15 (door-102 at cutoffs 2026-06-04 and 2026-06-06: finish fulfilled, fire_rating not_in_force): overall is fulfilled."
